+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project has no recorded decision specifying a transport compression codec. Nothing is documented in the repository (README, CHANGELOG, or docs) that designates a particular compression scheme for transport; compression is left to be handled by external middleware (e.g. community packages such as those listed under gin-contrib) rather than by a codec choice recorded in this project.
